================================================================================
1. DEFINITIONS & SCOPE
================================================================================
- "The Mod" refers to M.O.R.W.H.A across all past, present, and future versions,
  releases, tags, and git commits, including its SKSE C++ source code, prebuilt
  synthesis libraries (`SKSE_Source/external/morwha_core/`), compiled binaries
  (`MORWHA.dll`), Papyrus scripts (`Scripts/Source/*.psc` and compiled `.pex`
  files), JSON/INI configurations, documentation, and all associated assets in
  this repository.
- "Author" refers to tetherball88.
- "Public API Files" refers strictly to:
  1. `SKSE_Source/modules/bridge_c_api/include/MORWHA_PublicAPI.h`
  2. `Scripts/Source/MORWHA.psc`

================================================================================
2. PERMITTED USES (WHAT YOU MAY DO)
================================================================================
Subject to the restrictions in Section 3, the Author grants you the following
non-exclusive, royalty-free permissions:

a) Personal Use:
   You may download, inspect, and compile the source code for your own personal,
   private gameplay and testing.

b) Contributions (GitHub Forks & Pull Requests):
   In accordance with the GitHub Terms of Service, you may fork this repository
   on GitHub, make modifications in your fork for testing or development, and
   submit Pull Requests, bug reports, or issues back to the official repository.

c) Compatibility Patches, Add-ons & Integrations:
   You may create and publish independent compatibility patches, declarative
   JSON/JSLOT asset packs (`ChimeraAccessories`, `ChimeraRaces`, `FaceAnchors`),
   or third-party mods that interface with The Mod, PROVIDED THAT:
   - Your patch or mod requires the official release of M.O.R.W.H.A as an
     external dependency; and
   - Your upload does NOT bundle, repackage, or redistribute `MORWHA.dll`,
     prebuilt `morwha_core` static libraries, or M.O.R.W.H.A core scripts
     (except for the Public API Files covered in Section 4).

================================================================================
3. PROHIBITED USES (WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO)
================================================================================
Without prior written permission from the Author, you may NOT:

a) Redistribute or Re-upload:
   Upload, host, mirror, or distribute The Mod (in whole or in part, whether
   unmodified or modified, from any version or commit) as a standalone mod, fork,
   or replacement package on Nexus Mods, Steam Workshop, Bethesda.net, Discord,
   Patreon, LoversLab, or any other website or platform.

b) Plagiarize, Rebrand, or Reverse-Engineer Core Libraries:
   Copy substantial portions of the C++ implementation to publish under your own
   name or as a competing/derivative standalone mod, or decompile, disassemble,
   reverse-engineer, or extract algorithms from `MORWHA.dll` or the prebuilt
   `morwha_core` binary libraries (`SKSE_Source/external/morwha_core/lib/`).

c) Commercial Use or Paywalling:
   Sell, rent, sublicense, or place The Mod, any patch, or any derivative work
   behind a paywall, donation lock, or commercial subscription.

